# See https://help.github.com/articles/ignoring-files/ for more about ignoring files.

# dependencies
/node_modules
# ネイティブ版(choreon-app)は同じリポジトリの別プロジェクト。
# 上の /node_modules は【ルート直下だけ】を外すので、こちらは別途要る
/choreon-app/node_modules
/choreon-app/.expo/
/choreon-app/dist/
/choreon-app/web-build/
/choreon-app/expo-env.d.ts
/.pnp
.pnp.*
.yarn/*
!.yarn/patches
!.yarn/plugins
!.yarn/releases
!.yarn/versions

# testing
/coverage

# next.js
/.next/
/out/

# production
/build

# misc
.DS_Store
*.pem

# debug
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.pnpm-debug.log*

# env files (can opt-in for committing if needed)
.env*
!.env.example

# vercel
.vercel

# typescript
*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts

# reference screenshots dropped into the repo root during work sessions
/*.jpg
/*.jpeg
/*.png

# design tool exports dropped into the repo root (reference only, never built).
# Kept as a guard: the export also leaves loose companions behind, and one of
# them (support.js) fails `npm run verify` on rules meant for our own source.
/design_handoff_*/
/*.dc.html
/support.js
/.thumbnail
/uploads/

# Claude Code の端末ごとの設定(権限の許可リストなど)。
# スキル(.claude/skills)は共有するが、これは各自のものなので追跡しない
.claude/settings.local.json
